    "Id": "mechdef_woodsman_WDM-FB",
    "Name": "ReportMeMech",
    "Details": "The Woodsman is one of the oldest OmniMechs and is the progenitor to the famous Timber Wolf, as well as the Gargoyle, Naga, and Naga II OmniMechs. Pioneered by Clan Wolf, the Woodsman is one of the most important and foundational OmniMechs ever created. Built on a 300-rated fusion engine with an Endo-Steel frame and hardwired MASC for extra speed, the Woodsman is a durable chassis and is well suited to any mission. The Prime config is a preview of the later Timber Wolf: two ER Large Lasers, three ER Medium Lasers, two LRM-15s, two Machine Guns, and a solitary ER Small Laser.",
